 10. AUTOMATED SYSTEMS AND AI
================================================================================

   10.1 Assisted development is fine.
        You may use software tools, including AI coding assistants and agents,
        to read the Software and to help You do what this License permits,
        for example to explain code, to review a Public Fork or to prepare a
        Contribution, as long as the use stays within this License.

   10.2 No bulk harvesting for training.
        You may not copy, scrape, crawl, mirror or bulk-process the Software, its
        documentation or its decision records for the purpose of training,
        fine-tuning, distilling, or building the retrieval corpus of a machine
        learning model or a product that You offer to others, without Written
        Permission. This does not restrict ordinary search-engine indexing of
        the Licensor's public repository, and it does not restrict what the law
        allows regardless of a contract.

   10.3 Responsibility.
        You are responsible for what tools do in Your name. An agent's action
        is Your action.

   10.4 Reverse direction.
